taos> EXPLAIN SELECT a.ts, a.device, b.metric FROM l_norm a JOIN r_norm b ON a.ts = b.ts AND a.device = b.device \G;
*************************** 1.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN: -> Projection (columns=3 width=30 input_order=asc)
*************************** 2.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:    -> Inner Join (columns=4 width=48 input_order=asc algo=Hash)
*************************** 3.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:       -> Partition on Column device (width=26)
*************************** 4.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:          -> Table Scan on l_norm (columns=2 width=26 order=[asc|1 desc|0] mode=ts_order data_load=data)
*************************** 5.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:       -> Data Exchange 1:1 (width=30)
*************************** 6.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:          -> Partition on Column device (width=30)
*************************** 7.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:             -> Table Scan on r_norm (columns=3 width=30 order=[asc|1 desc|0] mode=ts_order data_load=data)

